    "description": "Sharky World Cup Vibe Jam — Create, Clip & Earn 🌎⚽🎮 Make the World Cup playable. Sharky.gg is the first AI-native multiplayer game creation platform. Prompt a game. Share the link. Play with friends in Discord. Seconds, not weeks. From May 20 – June 20, we’re running the Sharky World Cup Vibe Jam — a 32-day creator campaign for creators, editors, streamers, and UGC makers. There are two separate ways to earn: 🎬 PATH 1 — Clips Reward: $3 per 1K views This path is for creators who want to make short-form clips, edits, reactions, or UGC content. You do not need to build an original World Cup game for this path. Just make good Sharky content. You can create clips in three ways: Option A — Play and record Sharky games. Visit sharky.gg, explore any public Sharky room, play the game, record the gameplay, and turn the best moments into TikToks / Reels / Shorts. World Cup theme is not required — any Sharky room is fair game. Option B — Find games in Discord. Join our Discord community, find rooms created by other Sharky creators, invite friends to play together, record the gameplay, and edit the funniest or most chaotic moments into clips. Useful Discord channels: #game-moments · #world-cup-jam · #play-create-share · #global-game-test-room · #creator-live-chat Option C — Edit from our Google Drive folder. You can also directly use videos from our shared content folder, including gameplay recordings, livestream clips, and promotional clips made by creators / bloggers. Cut, remix, caption, and turn them into short-form content. 💰 Clips Reward: $0.5-$3 per 1K views on approved clips of any Sharky room. 🏆 PATH 2 — World Cup Game Campaign: Build, Clip & Win This path is for creators who want to build an original World Cup-themed multiplayer game on Sharky. To join the World Cup Game Campaign, you need to register on sharky.gg, get your invite code, and sign up for the World Cup Vibe Jam campaign. After joining, create your own original World Cup-themed multiplayer room. Examples: World Cup prediction games, football imposter rooms, fan battle quizzes, meme chaos rooms, watch-party games, team-vs-team party games, or any original football-inspired multiplayer experience. Submit your room in #world-cup-jam. If your room ranks Top 5 by player count, you can share the $2,500 prize pool and qualify for the Sharky Ambassador Program — sponsorship + ongoing perks. Prize pool: 🥇 1st — $1,000+ 🥈 2nd — $625+ 🥉 3rd — $375+ 4th — $250+ 5th — $250+ You can stack both rewards: build your own World Cup game, invite players, record the gameplay, post clips, earn $3 per 1K views, and still compete for the $2,500 game campaign prize pool. ✅ How to Join Step 1 — Apply. Fill out the campaign questionnaire to sign up as a creator. Step 2 — Register & Connect. Join the sharky.gg waitlist and our Discord. You’ll receive your invite code and free credits for up to 20 multiplayer-game creates. Step 3 — Choose Your Path. For Clips Reward, play Sharky games, record gameplay, or edit videos from our Google Drive content folder. For World Cup Game Campaign, create an original World Cup-themed multiplayer game and submit it in #world-cup-jam. Step 4 — Create & Publish. Post your clips, reactions, gameplay edits, or meme edits on TikTok / Reels / Shorts with #Sharky #SharkyVibeJam. Step 5 — Get Paid. Approved clips earn based on views. Original World Cup game creators may also qualify for the $2,500 Game Campaign prize pool and the Sharky Ambassador Program. ✅ What Works We judge by hook + retention, not face cam. 📹 Reaction UGC — face cam + screen recording + real reactions 🎮 Gameplay Clips — gameplay recording with overlay text hooks 🎬 Meme Mashups — meme edits with music, jokes, and fast cuts 🏆 Highlight Reels — best moments, 60s max, strong music 📊 Slideshow / VO — TikTok slideshow with screenshots + text 🎯 Hook Templates World Cup angle: “I told AI to make a World Cup imposter game and chaos ensued…” “This is what happens when AI runs your World Cup prediction game.” “I built a World Cup meme room in 60 seconds.” “POV: You let AI host your World Cup watch party.” “Tell me why this AI football game is funnier than the actual match.” General Sharky angle: “AI just made the best party game I’ve ever played with friends.” “I made a multiplayer game in 60 seconds and now my group chat won’t shut up.” “Rating 5 AI-made games my friends actually played twice.” “POV: Your group chat finally found a game everyone agrees on.” “This AI game generator is what Among Us should have been.” 📐 Format 15–60s vertical video, 9:16, for TikTok / Reels / Shorts. Strong hook in the first 2 seconds. Use captions because most viewers watch muted. End with sharky.gg + #Sharky #SharkyVibeJam. ❌ Don’t No FIFA footage. No broadcast clips. No official match footage. No betting / odds / gambling framing — Sharky is not a betting product. No claims that real teams or players endorse Sharky. No fully static screen recordings without edit, music, or text. Low-effort content may be rejected. 🔗 Waitlist: https://sharky.gg 🔗 Discord: https://discord.gg/CYgR7YsmAg 🎨 Gameplay clips, logo & brand assets: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/14nwSI8GENhIBEgfjP4XwYzfaZrQd_zfr?usp=sharing Build. Clip. Remix. Win. Let’s make games playable. 🌎🎮",
